00:07:12,541 --> 00:07:16,961
<font color="#ffff00">ELEANOR: Obsessed. Completely obsessed with Clint Barton since...</font>
<font color="#00ffcc">Obsesionada. Totalmente obsesionada con Clint Barton desde...</font>

124
00:07:17,291 --> 00:07:19,211
<font color="#ffff00">Well, ever since the attack.</font>
<font color="#00ffcc">Desde el ataque.</font>

125
